sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Pipeline
    participant K8sAPI as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Training Operator Webhook<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Reconciler as Training Operator Reconciler<br/>controller-runtime
    participant Workers as Worker Pods<br/>+ Services, SAs, PodGroups
    participant OpenShift as OpenShift APIServer<br/>config.openshift.io/v1
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over Reconciler,OpenShift: Flow 2: OpenShift TLS Profile Bootstrap (startup)
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: GET config.openshift.io/v1/apiservers/cluster<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: TLS profile (minVersion, cipherSuites)<br/>or 404/error
    alt OpenShift cluster
        Note right of Reconciler: Apply platform TLS profile<br/>to webhook server
    else Non-OpenShift or unavailable
        Note right of Reconciler: Fall back to TLS 1.2<br/>intermediate cipher suites
    end

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 1: Training Job Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/kubeflow.org/v1/.../pytorchjobs<br/>Auth: Bearer token / kubeconfig
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-kubeflow-org-v1-pytorchjob<br/>HTTPS/9443, TLS, Kubernetes admission
    alt Validation succeeds
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Allowed
    else Validation fails
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Denied (failurePolicy: Fail)
        K8sAPI-->>User: 422 Validation Error
    end

    Note right of Reconciler: Watch event triggers reconciliation

    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: PyTorchJob CR event (via informer)

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create worker Pods<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Pod created
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create Services<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Service created
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: ServiceAccount created

    opt Gang Scheduling enabled
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create PodGroup<br/>(scheduling.volcano.sh or scheduling.x-k8s.io)
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: PodGroup created
    end

    opt Network isolation
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: NetworkPolicy created
    end

    opt PyTorch elastic training
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create HorizontalPodAutoscaler
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: HPA created
    end

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update PyTorchJob status<br/>PATCH /status
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Status updated

    Note over Prometheus,Reconciler: Metrics collection (continuous)
    Prometheus->>Reconciler: GET :8080/metrics<br/>HTTP, no auth
    Reconciler-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics
